# Allowlist. This folder lives in a public repository, so only reviewed Markdown
# records and map-audit screenshots may be tracked here. Signed originals, counsel
# opinions, filings, personal data and secrets stay outside git (see README.md).
# `git add -f` bypasses this file, and nothing in CI catches it until secret
# scanning ships with T-TL-02.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*.md
!map-audit/**/*.png
!map-audit/**/*.webp
